WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:02.994
I redrew Holmes’s eighteen eighty-two view
of Zion

2
00:00:03.029 --> 00:00:04.837
using modern elevation data.

3
00:00:08.144 --> 00:00:09.517
It starts with the skyline,

4
00:00:09.552 --> 00:00:11.807
then works forward, line by line.

5
00:00:14.969 --> 00:00:17.288
Look at how closely the ridgelines match.

6
00:00:17.401 --> 00:00:19.600
He drew the temples about a quarter
taller.

7
00:00:21.577 --> 00:00:22.609
I kept that stretch

8
00:00:22.644 --> 00:00:23.846
and added a pale tint

9
00:00:23.881 --> 00:00:25.719
to bring out the shaded faces.
